  {
    "task_id": "H-R1",
    "key": "src/start/exceptions.md#Exceptions",
    "quote": "In a multicore system, where multiple processor cores are executing code concurrently, the potential for reentrancy issues becomes relevant again, even within exception handlers.",
    "char_start": 2203,
    "char_end": 2381,
    "source_sha256": "950767654a665668ff972d1e66830e2525358acaebc63aaf97f7008d2f740d71"
  },
  {
    "task_id": "H-R1",
    "key": "src/start/exceptions.md#Exceptions",
    "quote": "proper synchronization mechanisms need to be employed within the exception handlers to ensure that access to shared resources is properly coordinated among the cores.",
    "char_start": 2608,
    "char_end": 2774,
    "source_sha256": "950767654a665668ff972d1e66830e2525358acaebc63aaf97f7008d2f740d71"
  },
